1. VPC FUNDAMENTALS
==============================================================================

1.1 What is a VPC?
- Virtual Private Cloud: Isolated network environment in cloud
- Complete control over network configuration
- Subnets, route tables, gateways, security groups
- Custom IP addressing (CIDR blocks)

1.2 VPC Components:
  * CIDR Block (e.g., 10.0.0.0/16)
  * Subnets (public and private)
  * Internet Gateway (IGW)
  * NAT Gateway
  * Route Tables
  * Network ACLs
  * Security Groups
  * VPC Endpoints

1.3 VPC CIDR Planning:
  Example: 10.0.0.0/16 (65,536 IPs)
  - Public Subnet 1:  10.0.1.0/24 (256 IPs)
  - Public Subnet 2:  10.0.2.0/24 (256 IPs)
  - Private Subnet 1: 10.0.10.0/24 (256 IPs)
  - Private Subnet 2: 10.0.11.0/24 (256 IPs)

